# The Quiet Line: a strange late-night board with a single line (M19).
# It carries step 4 of the hidden story, The Fourth State (docs/net/STORY.md).
NUMBER 9-13-13
NAME THE QUIET LINE
SYSOP NIGHTWATCH
COLORS 0 -13
LINES 1
MESSAGES NIGHT NIGHT THOUGHTS
WELCOME
 .
       .
   THE QUIET LINE
             .
 ONE LINE. ONE CALLER.
     SPEAK SOFTLY.
END

POST NIGHT 1985-01-30 02:13 NIGHTWATCH
SUBJECT THE LINE IS OPEN
THIS BOARD ANSWERS AT ANY HOUR, BUT IT IS BEST AFTER MIDNIGHT, WHEN THE CITY SLEEPS AND THE EXCHANGE IS QUIET.
ONE CALLER AT A TIME. IF YOU HEAR BUSY, SOMEONE ELSE IS LISTENING.
.

POST NIGHT 1985-03-09 01:40 OWL
SUBJECT COUNTING IN THREES
AT NIGHT I COUNT THE LIGHTS IN THE BLOCK ACROSS THE STREET. ON, OFF, AND THE ONES THAT FLICKER. THREE STATES. EVEN THE WINDOWS ARE TERNARY.
.

POST NIGHT 1985-07-21 03:05 NIGHTWATCH
SUBJECT THE HUM
SOMETIMES, BETWEEN THE CHARACTERS, THE LINE HUMS. THE ENGINEERS SAY IT IS NOTHING. I LIKE TO THINK IT IS THE NETWORK BREATHING.
.

# The Fourth State, step 4 (docs/net/STORY.md)
POST NIGHT 1985-11-01 03:03 NIGHTWATCH
SUBJECT THREE DOORS
IF IT IS TRUE THEN GO HOME
MAYBE STAY AND LISTEN
ELSE FORGET YOU EVER CALLED
THERE ARE THREE DOORS OUT OF EVERY IF. THE ENGINEERS OF BENCH 4 FOUND A FOURTH. THEY HID ITS NUMBER WHERE NOBODY READS: IN A SUM. A SUM IS SOMETIMES A NUMBER YOU CAN CALL.
.
